             <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 font-bold"><div class="bg-blue-100 p-1 rounded-md"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div> Ultra Hızlı Yükleme (Modern Web Mimarisi)</li>
             <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 font-bold"><div class="bg-blue-100 p-1 rounded-md"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div> İçerik ve Blog Yönetim Sistemleri</li>
             <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 font-bold"><div class="bg-blue-100 p-1 rounded-md"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div> Gelişmiş SEO Altyapısı</li>
