           <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Toplantı ve Veri Analizi" class="rounded-3xl shadow-lg w-full max-w-md aspect-[4/3] object-cover border border-slate-200 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500" />
        </div>
      </div>

